{"seq":2,"slug":"tokio-for-cli","title":"Tokio 异步 CLI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/rust-cli/tokio-for-cli","wordCount":699,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"tokio-异步-cli\">Tokio 异步 CLI</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>Tokio</strong> 是 Rust 的异步运行时。对 CLI 而言，引入异步不是默认选择——<strong>只有当存在并发 IO 时它才值得</strong>，否则同步代码更简单、更易调试。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>需求</th>\n<th>是否用异步</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文件处理</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>同步 IO 已足够快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单次网络请求</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>同步库更简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发网络请求</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>需要同时等待多个 IO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件监听/信号处理</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>事件驱动的持续运行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一旦决定使用，还需区分两种入口：<strong>短暂任务</strong>用显式构建的 runtime，<strong>常驻程序</strong>用 <code>#[tokio::main]</code>；并据此配置运行时参数与信号处理。本文依次展开这些主题。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"何时需要异步\">何时需要异步</h2><p>并非所有 CLI 工具都需要<strong>异步运行时</strong>（Async Runtime）。同步代码更简单、调试更容易。只有在以下场景中，引入 Tokio 才有明确价值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>是否需要异步</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文件处理</td>\n<td>通常不需要</td>\n<td>同步 IO 已足够快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单次 HTTP 请求</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>ureq 等同步库更简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发网络请求</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>同时请求多个 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件监听</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>事件驱动的持续运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WebSocket</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>长连接通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子进程并发管理</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>同时运行多个任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[CLI 工具需求] --&gt; B{并发 IO?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[同步代码]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{长时间运行?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[&quot;tokio::runtime::Runtime&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F[#35;[tokio::main]&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[CLI 工具需求] --&gt; B{并发 IO?}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[同步代码]\n    B --&gt;|是| D{长时间运行?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[\"tokio::runtime::Runtime\"]\n    D --&gt;|是| F[#35;[tokio::main]\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"async-main-入口\">Async Main 入口</h2><p>Tokio 提供的 <code>#[tokio::main]</code> 宏将 <code>main</code> 函数转换为异步入口点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use clap::Parser;&#10;use anyhow::Result;&#10;&#10;#[derive(Parser)]&#10;struct Cli {&#10;    #[arg(help = &quot;要检查的 URL 列表&quot;)]&#10;    urls: Vec&lt;String&gt;,&#10;&#10;    #[arg(short, long, default_value_t = 5)]&#10;    timeout: u64,&#10;&#10;    #[arg(short, long, default_value_t = 10)]&#10;    concurrency: usize,&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[tokio::main]&#10;async fn main() -&gt; Result&lt;()&gt; {&#10;    let cli = Cli::parse();&#10;&#10;    if cli.urls.is_empty() {&#10;        anyhow::bail!(&quot;至少提供一个 URL&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;检查 {} 个 URL (并发: {}, 超时: {}s)&quot;,&#10;        cli.urls.len(), cli.concurrency, cli.timeout);&#10;&#10;    check_urls(&amp;cli.urls, cli.timeout, cli.concurrency).await?;&#10;    Ok(())&#10;}&#10;&#10;async fn check_urls(urls: &amp;[String], timeout: u64, concurrency: usize) -&gt; Result&lt;()&gt; {&#10;    let client = reqwest::Client::builder()&#10;        .timeout(std::time::Duration::from_secs(timeout))&#10;        .build()?;&#10;&#10;    let semaphore = std::sync::Arc::new(tokio::sync::Semaphore::new(concurrency));&#10;    let mut handles = vec![];&#10;&#10;    for url in urls {&#10;        let client = client.clone();&#10;        let url = url.clone();&#10;        let sem = semaphore.clone();&#10;&#10;        let handle = tokio::spawn(async move {&#10;            let _permit = sem.acquire().await.unwrap();&#10;            match client.get(&amp;url).send().await {&#10;                Ok(resp) =&gt; println!(&quot;  ✓ {} → {}&quot;, url, resp.status()),&#10;                Err(e) =&gt; eprintln!(&quot;  ✗ {} → {}&quot;, url, e),&#10;            }&#10;        });&#10;        handles.push(handle);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    for h in handles {&#10;        h.await?;&#10;    }&#10;    Ok(())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use clap::Parser;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use anyhow::Result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Parser)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Cli {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[arg(help = \"要检查的 URL 列表\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    urls: Vec&#x3C;String>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[arg(short, long, default_value_t = 5)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    timeout: u64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[arg(short, long, default_value_t = 10)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    concurrency: usize,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[tokio::main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn main() -> Result&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let cli = Cli::parse();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if cli.urls.is_empty() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        anyhow::bail!(\"至少提供一个 URL\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"检查 {} 个 URL (并发: {}, 超时: {}s)\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cli.urls.len(), cli.concurrency, cli.timeout);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    check_urls(&#x26;cli.urls, cli.timeout, cli.concurrency).await?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn check_urls(urls: &#x26;[String], timeout: u64, concurrency: usize) -> Result&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let client = reqwest::Client::builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .timeout(std::time::Duration::from_secs(timeout))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build()?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let semaphore = std::sync::Arc::new(tokio::sync::Semaphore::new(concurrency));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut handles = vec![];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for url in urls {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let client = client.clone();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let url = url.clone();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let sem = semaphore.clone();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let handle = tokio::spawn(async move {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let _permit = sem.acquire().await.unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            match client.get(&#x26;url).send().await {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Ok(resp) => println!(\"  ✓ {} → {}\", url, resp.status()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Err(e) => eprintln!(\"  ✗ {} → {}\", url, e),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        handles.push(handle);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for h in handles {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        h.await?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"并发任务编排\">并发任务编排</h2><p>CLI 工具中的常见模式是同时执行多个独立任务，然后收集结果。Tokio 的 <code>JoinSet</code> 和 <code>tokio::select!</code> 是核心工具。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use tokio::task::JoinSet;&#10;use anyhow::Result;&#10;use std::time::Duration;&#10;&#10;struct TaskResult {&#10;    name: String,&#10;    duration: Duration,&#10;    success: bool,&#10;}&#10;&#10;async fn run_pipeline() -&gt; Result&lt;Vec&lt;TaskResult&gt;&gt; {&#10;    let mut set = JoinSet::new();&#10;&#10;    set.spawn(async {&#10;        let start = std::time::Instant::now();&#10;        tokio::time::sleep(Duration::from_millis(500)).await;&#10;        TaskResult { name: &quot;lint&quot;.into(), duration: start.elapsed(), success: true }&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    set.spawn(async {&#10;        let start = std::time::Instant::now();&#10;        tokio::time::sleep(Duration::from_millis(800)).await;&#10;        TaskResult { name: &quot;typecheck&quot;.into(), duration: start.elapsed(), success: true }&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    set.spawn(async {&#10;        let start = std::time::Instant::now();&#10;        tokio::time::sleep(Duration::from_millis(300)).await;&#10;        TaskResult { name: &quot;test&quot;.into(), duration: start.elapsed(), success: true }&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    let mut results = vec![];&#10;    while let Some(res) = set.join_next().await {&#10;        results.push(res?);&#10;    }&#10;    Ok(results)&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[tokio::main]&#10;async fn main() -&gt; Result&lt;()&gt; {&#10;    let results = run_pipeline().await?;&#10;    for r in &amp;results {&#10;        let icon = if r.success { &quot;✓&quot; } else { &quot;✗&quot; };&#10;        println!(&quot;{} {} ({:.1}s)&quot;, icon, r.name, r.duration.as_secs_f64());&#10;    }&#10;    Ok(())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio::task::JoinSet;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use anyhow::Result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::time::Duration;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct TaskResult {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    duration: Duration,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    success: bool,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn run_pipeline() -> Result&#x3C;Vec&#x3C;TaskResult>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut set = JoinSet::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    set.spawn(async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let start = std::time::Instant::now();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tokio::time::sleep(Duration::from_millis(500)).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        TaskResult { name: \"lint\".into(), duration: start.elapsed(), success: true }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    set.spawn(async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let start = std::time::Instant::now();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tokio::time::sleep(Duration::from_millis(800)).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        TaskResult { name: \"typecheck\".into(), duration: start.elapsed(), success: true }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    set.spawn(async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let start = std::time::Instant::now();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tokio::time::sleep(Duration::from_millis(300)).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        TaskResult { name: \"test\".into(), duration: start.elapsed(), success: true }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut results = vec![];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    while let Some(res) = set.join_next().await {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        results.push(res?);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(results)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[tokio::main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn main() -> Result&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let results = run_pipeline().await?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for r in &#x26;results {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let icon = if r.success { \"✓\" } else { \"✗\" };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"{} {} ({:.1}s)\", icon, r.name, r.duration.as_secs_f64());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>并发原语</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>tokio::spawn</code></td>\n<td>启动独立任务</td>\n<td>并发执行不相关操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>JoinSet</code></td>\n<td>管理任务集合</td>\n<td>等待一组任务完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Semaphore</code></td>\n<td>限制并发数</td>\n<td>控制 API 请求频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tokio::select!</code></td>\n<td>竞争多个 future</td>\n<td>超时控制、取消操作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"信号处理\">信号处理</h2><p>CLI 工具需要正确响应<strong>操作系统信号</strong>（Signals），特别是 Ctrl+C（SIGINT）和 SIGTERM。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use tokio::signal;&#10;use tokio::sync::watch;&#10;use anyhow::Result;&#10;&#10;async fn graceful_server(mut shutdown_rx: watch::Receiver&lt;bool&gt;) -&gt; Result&lt;()&gt; {&#10;    let mut interval = tokio::time::interval(std::time::Duration::from_secs(1));&#10;    let mut count = 0;&#10;&#10;    loop {&#10;        tokio::select! {&#10;            _ = interval.tick() =&gt; {&#10;                count += 1;&#10;                println!(&quot;处理第 {} 个任务...&quot;, count);&#10;            }&#10;            _ = shutdown_rx.changed() =&gt; {&#10;                println!(&quot;收到关闭信号，正在清理...&quot;);&#10;                tokio::time::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis(500)).await;&#10;                println!(&quot;清理完成&quot;);&#10;                break;&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    Ok(())&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[tokio::main]&#10;async fn main() -&gt; Result&lt;()&gt; {&#10;    let (shutdown_tx, shutdown_rx) = watch::channel(false);&#10;&#10;    let server_handle = tokio::spawn(graceful_server(shutdown_rx));&#10;&#10;    signal::ctrl_c().await?;&#10;    println!(&quot;\\n收到 Ctrl+C&quot;);&#10;    shutdown_tx.send(true)?;&#10;&#10;    server_handle.await??;&#10;    println!(&quot;程序退出&quot;);&#10;    Ok(())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio::signal;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio::sync::watch;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use anyhow::Result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn graceful_server(mut shutdown_rx: watch::Receiver&#x3C;bool>) -> Result&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut interval = tokio::time::interval(std::time::Duration::from_secs(1));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut count = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tokio::select! {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _ = interval.tick() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                count += 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                println!(\"处理第 {} 个任务...\", count);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _ = shutdown_rx.changed() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                println!(\"收到关闭信号，正在清理...\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                tokio::time::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis(500)).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                println!(\"清理完成\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[tokio::main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn main() -> Result&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let (shutdown_tx, shutdown_rx) = watch::channel(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let server_handle = tokio::spawn(graceful_server(shutdown_rx));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    signal::ctrl_c().await?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"\\n收到 Ctrl+C\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    shutdown_tx.send(true)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    server_handle.await??;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"程序退出\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Ctrl+C / SIGTERM] --&gt; B[信号处理器]&#10;    B --&gt; C[设置关闭标志]&#10;    C --&gt; D[通知运行中的任务]&#10;    D --&gt; E[任务完成当前工作]&#10;    E --&gt; F[清理资源]&#10;    F --&gt; G[退出程序]\">graph TD\n    A[Ctrl+C / SIGTERM] --&gt; B[信号处理器]\n    B --&gt; C[设置关闭标志]\n    C --&gt; D[通知运行中的任务]\n    D --&gt; E[任务完成当前工作]\n    E --&gt; F[清理资源]\n    F --&gt; G[退出程序]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 永远不要在信号处理中直接调用 <code>process::exit()</code>。让正在运行的任务有机会完成当前工作并清理资源。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"运行时配置\">运行时配置</h2><p>根据 CLI 工具的需求选择合适的 Tokio 运行时配置。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>宏属性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多线程</td>\n<td>高并发网络 IO</td>\n<td><code>#[tokio::main]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单线程</td>\n<td>简单异步任务</td>\n<td><code>#[tokio::main(flavor = &quot;current_thread&quot;)]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>精细控制</td>\n<td><code>Runtime::builder()</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use tokio::runtime::Runtime;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let rt = Runtime::builder()&#10;        .worker_threads(2)&#10;        .enable_io()&#10;        .enable_time()&#10;        .build()&#10;        .unwrap();&#10;&#10;    rt.block_on(async {&#10;        println!(&quot;在自定义运行时中执行&quot;);&#10;    });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio::runtime::Runtime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let rt = Runtime::builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .worker_threads(2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .enable_io()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .enable_time()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    rt.block_on(async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"在自定义运行时中执行\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Tokio 异步 CLI))&#10;    何时使用&#10;      并发网络请求&#10;      文件监听&#10;      子进程管理&#10;    入口模式&#10;      tokio::main 宏&#10;      Runtime::builder&#10;      current_thread&#10;    并发编排&#10;      JoinSet&#10;      Semaphore&#10;      select!&#10;    信号处理&#10;      Ctrl+C / SIGTERM&#10;      优雅关闭&#10;      资源清理\">mindmap\n  root((Tokio 异步 CLI))\n    何时使用\n      并发网络请求\n      文件监听\n      子进程管理\n    入口模式\n      tokio::main 宏\n      Runtime::builder\n      current_thread\n    并发编排\n      JoinSet\n      Semaphore\n      select!\n    信号处理\n      Ctrl+C / SIGTERM\n      优雅关闭\n      资源清理</pre><ul>\n<li>并非所有 CLI 工具都需要异步，单次操作和简单文件处理优先使用同步代码</li>\n<li><code>#[tokio::main]</code> 是最常用的异步入口，简单任务可用 <code>current_thread</code> 模式减少开销</li>\n<li><code>JoinSet</code> 管理并发任务集合，<code>Semaphore</code> 控制并发度，<code>select!</code> 实现竞争和超时</li>\n<li>信号处理应通过 <code>watch</code> 或 <code>CancellationToken</code> 通知任务优雅关闭，而非直接退出</li>\n<li>运行时配置应根据实际需求选择，大多数 CLI 工具使用默认配置即可</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Tokio 异步 CLI","id":"tokio-异步-cli"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"何时需要异步","id":"何时需要异步"},{"level":2,"text":"Async Main 入口","id":"async-main-入口"},{"level":2,"text":"并发任务编排","id":"并发任务编排"},{"level":2,"text":"信号处理","id":"信号处理"},{"level":2,"text":"运行时配置","id":"运行时配置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Clap 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/rust-cli/clap-deep-dive"},"next":{"title":"交叉编译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/rust-cli/cross-compilation"}}